-- =============================================================================
-- CFMS 44 - Error code catalogue (scope Section 34.1). Idempotent.
--   * one entry for every rule the database raises (app.fail short codes), plus the
--     codes the API needs for sign-in, access, integrations and unexpected errors
--   * SQLSTATE and named-constraint maps for errors PostgreSQL raises itself
--   * error codes each workflow action can return
-- Codes are never reused or renumbered: retire a code with is_active = false.
-- Existing rows are updated from this file (it is the release source of truth).
-- =============================================================================
SET app.channel TO 'MIGRATION';

